erous to confront.<br><br>This is our last chance to reclaim the galaxy, dismantle the Architects\u2019 empire, and unearth the secrets of their origin. The final war begins, and humanity\u2019s fate rests in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537830/extras/9f28481e202aba6d27c5275424ce16a5.poster.avif?t=1754048832\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537830/extras/9f28481e202aba6d27c5275424ce16a5.webm?t=1754048832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537830/extras/9f28481e202aba6d27c5275424ce16a5.mp4?t=1754048832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
